# C1: CHURN under the reservation on the levers arm c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best (the C9 lengths of tp4-262k8-jobs, retargeted from the 8x262k-gate): sixteen users over eight seats - three 253,920, three 200,000, 131,072,
# 65,536, 32,768, 16,384, 8,192, 4,096, then 253,920, 200,000, 131,072 and a short 1,536 - every budget 1,024 with ignore_eos, started 30 s apart. The pool is 19,968 blocks (four full windows plus change, not five), so the
# reservation holds are different from the 21,760-block pool C9 was written for. READ: zero aborts, zero refusals, zero engine deaths, every seat answering after the streams; at least eight replacements seen as departures;
# a 'kv reservation hold' followed by 'released' (else NOT_EXERCISED: a churn that never outran the pool proved nothing); reserved + running <= pool on every KV line; no DRAM hold with a seat free; ZERO audit mismatches
# (the extent audit). No reference comparison: it judges the churn and the reservation, not correctness past 131k. Duration (estimate): 240 min. Soft job.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/262k8 eight-seat 262k development window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/262k8 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-best-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/262k8 commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-262k8-best-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best
C2_GATE_PLAN=churn
C2_GATE_LENGTHS=253920,253920,253920,200000,200000,200000,131072,65536,32768,16384,8192,4096,253920,200000,131072,1536
C2_GATE_MAX_TOKENS=1024
C2_GATE_JIT=record
C2_GATE_AUDITS=extent
